# Listenable.merge and Flutter web

Do not call `Listenable.merge([...])` inside `build()`. That creates a new listenable every frame and Flutter web hits:

`Assertion failed: _dependents.isEmpty is not true` (`framework.dart` InheritedElement.debugDeactivated).

Use `StableMergedListenableBuilder` (cached merge) instead. Keep `LazyIndexedStack` children in `KeyedSubtree` so adding a tab does not deactivate existing calendars.
